  "referenceNumber": "INU0282",
  "remarks": "\nHosein SALIMI is an involved person within the meaning of the Iran (Sanctions) (Nuclear) (EU Exit) Regulations 2019. Hosein SALIMI is or has been providing support for and facilitating the proliferation or development of nuclear weapons in, or for use in, Iran, or an activity that could lead to the development of nuclear weapons in, or for use in, Iran. \n",
